=== Sequence behavior analysis ===
When a/b > 1: sequence grows (geometric-like)
When a/b = 1: sequence is constant
When a/b < 1: sequence decays to 0

=== Distinct values in pseudo-geometric sequences ===
All pairs (a,b) with 1≤a,b≤5, start=1, steps=5:
  Distinct values: 23
  Sum of distinct values: 5770
  Sum mod 1000000007: 5770

